  :q1 "eng.js — base or eng-dialect?"
  :q2 "ops.js — base or commerce-dialect?"
  :q3 "Coexist two REPLs (motoi + sakura)?"
  :q4 "Neutralize Sakura-branded defaults in motoi (✿ separator, cherry-blossom palette, ~/.sakura path)?"
  :q5 "reference-impls.js — keep monolithic or split by verb-family?"
  :q6 "sakura-scheme lib/ layout — mirror motoi's or stay flat?"
  :q7 "Sign off on adapter shape (14 no-op stubs interface) before wave 5?"
  :q8 "Confirm scheme-lang/_archive-2026-07-16-pass3/ as archive location for the 5 superseded files?"
  :q9 "Confirm domain libs (physics/chemistry/biology/stats/astronomy/earth/economics/linguistics) — are these lib subdirs, book companions, or both?"
  :q10 "For domain libs — priority order? Which domain first?")

